#: ../../content/administration.rst:8
msgid "Database management"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasini boshqarish"

#: ../../content/administration.rst:10
msgid ""
"These guides provide instructions on how to install, maintain and upgrade "
"Odoo databases."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu qo'llanmalar Odoo ma'lumotlar bazalarini o'rnatish, texnik xizmat "
"ko'rsatish va yangilash (upgrade) bo'yicha ko'rsatmalarni taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/administration.rst:13
msgid ":doc:`History of Versions <administration/standard_extended_support>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Versiyalar tarixi <administration/standard_extended_support>`"

#: ../../content/administration.rst:16
#: ../../content/administration/on_premise/geo_ip.rst:9
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "O'rnatish"

#: ../../content/administration.rst:18
msgid ""
"Depending on the intended use case, there are multiple ways to install Odoo "
"- or not install it at all."
msgstr ""
"Ko'zlangan foydalanish holatiga qarab, Odoo-ni o'rnatishning bir necha usuli "
"mavjud — yoki uni umuman o'rnatmaslik ham mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration.rst:21
msgid ""
":doc:`Online <administration/odoo_online>` is the easiest way to use Odoo in "
"production or to try it."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Online <administration/odoo_online>` — Odoo-ni ishlab chiqarishda "
"(production) ishlatish yoki sinab ko'rishning eng oson usuli."

#: ../../content/administration.rst:23
msgid ""
":doc:`Packaged installers <administration/on_premise/packages>` are suitable "
"for testing Odoo and developing modules. They can be used for long-term "
"production with additional deployment and maintenance work."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Paketlangan o'rnatuvchilar <administration/on_premise/packages>` Odoo-"
"ni test qilish va modullarni ishlab chiqish (development) uchun mos keladi. "
"Qo'shimcha joylashtirish (deploy) va texnik xizmat ko'rsatish ishlari bilan "
"ular uzoq muddatli ishlab chiqarish (production) uchun ham ishlatilishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration.rst:27
msgid ""
":doc:`Source install <administration/on_premise/source>` provides greater "
"flexibility, as it allows, for example, running multiple Odoo versions on "
"the same system. It is adequate to develop modules and can be used as a base "
"for production deployment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Manba kodidan o'rnatish <administration/on_premise/source>` ko'proq "
"moslashuvchanlikni ta'minlaydi, chunki u, masalan, bitta tizimda bir nechta "
"Odoo versiyalarini ishga tushirish imkonini beradi. U modullarni ishlab "
"chiqish (development) uchun mos va ishlab chiqarish (production) muhitiga "
"joylashtirish (deploy) uchun asos sifatida ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration.rst:31
msgid ""
"A `Docker <https://hub.docker.com/_/odoo/>`_ base image is available for "
"development or deployment."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqish (development) yoki joylashtirish (deploy) uchun `Docker "
"<https://hub.docker.com/_/odoo/>`_ asosiy obraz mavjud."

#: ../../content/administration.rst:37
msgid "Editions"
msgstr "Nashrlar"

#: ../../content/administration.rst:39
msgid "There are two different editions."
msgstr "Ikkita turli nashr mavjud."

#: ../../content/administration.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Odoo Community** is the free and open-source version of the software, "
"licensed under the `GNU LGPLv3 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/master/"
"LICENSE>`_. It is the core upon which Odoo Enterprise is built."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo Community** — dasturiy ta'minotning bepul va ochiq kodli versiyasi "
"bo'lib, `GNU LGPLv3 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/master/LICENSE>`_ "
"litsenziyasi asosida tarqatiladi. U Odoo Enterprise qurilgan yadro "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/administration.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Odoo Enterprise** is the shared source version of the software, giving "
"access to more functionalities, including functional support, upgrades, and "
"hosting. `Pricing <https://www.odoo.com/pricing-plan>`_ starts from one app "
"free."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo Enterprise** — dasturiy ta'minotning ulashilgan kodli (shared source) "
"versiyasi bo'lib, funksional qo'llab-quvvatlash, yangilashlar (upgrade) va "
"hosting kabi ko'proq funksiyalarga kirish imkonini beradi. `Narxlar <https://"
"www.odoo.com/pricing-plan>`_ bitta bepul ilovadan boshlanadi."

#: ../../content/administration.rst:50
msgid ""
":doc:`Switch from Community to Enterprise <administration/on_premise/"
"community_to_enterprise>` at any time (except for the source install)."
msgstr ""
"Istalgan vaqtda :doc:`Community-dan Enterprise-ga o'ting <administration/"
"on_premise/community_to_enterprise>` (manba kodidan o'rnatish bundan "
"mustasno)."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:3
msgid "Hosting"
msgstr "Hosting"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:8
msgid "Change hosting solution"
msgstr "Hosting yechimini o'zgartirish"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:10
msgid ""
"The instructions to change the hosting type of a database depend on the "
"current solution used and to which solution the database should be moved."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasining hosting turini o'zgartirish bo'yicha ko'rsatmalar "
"hozirda ishlatilayotgan yechimga va ma'lumotlar bazasi qaysi yechimga "
"ko'chirilishi kerakligiga bog'liq."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:14
msgid "Transferring an on-premise database"
msgstr "On-premise (lokal server) ma'lumotlar bazasini ko'chirish"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:17
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:106
msgid "To Odoo Online"
msgstr "Odoo Online-ga"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:20
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:109
msgid "Odoo Online is *not* compatible with **non-standard apps**."
msgstr "Odoo Online **nostandart ilovalar** bilan mos *emas*."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:21
msgid ""
"The database's current version must be :doc:`supported "
"<standard_extended_support>`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasining joriy versiyasi :doc:`qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan "
"<standard_extended_support>` bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:23
msgid "Create a :ref:`duplicate of the database <on-premise/duplicate>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Ma'lumotlar bazasining nusxasini <on-premise/duplicate>` yarating."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:24
msgid "In this duplicate, uninstall all **non-standard apps**."
msgstr "Ushbu nusxada barcha **nostandart ilovalarni** o'chirib tashlang."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:25
msgid "Use the database manager to grab a *dump with filestore*."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasi menejeridan foydalanib *filestore bilan dump* oling."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:26
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:112
msgid ""
"`Create a support ticket <https://www.odoo.com/help-form>`_ including the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagilarni kiritgan holda `qo'llab-quvvatlash so'rovini yarating <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help-form>`_:"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:28
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:114
msgid "your **subscription number**,"
msgstr "sizning **obuna raqamingiz**,"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:29
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:115
msgid ""
"the **URL** you want to use for the database (e.g., `company.odoo.com`),"
msgstr ""
"ma'lumotlar bazasi uchun ishlatmoqchi bo'lgan **URL** manzilingiz (masalan, "
"`company.odoo.com`),"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:30
msgid ""
"the **dump** as an attachment or as a link to the file (required for 60 MB+ "
"files),"
msgstr ""
"**dump** — biriktirma sifatida yoki faylga havola sifatida (60 MB dan katta "
"fayllar uchun talab qilinadi),"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:31
msgid "the **region** you wish to be hosted in,"
msgstr "hosting qilinishini istagan **mintaqangiz**,"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:34
msgid ""
"The list of available regions is available in `our privacy policy <https://"
"www.odoo.com/privacy#data-transfer>`_."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud mintaqalar ro'yxati `maxfiylik siyosatimizda <https://www.odoo.com/"
"privacy#data-transfer>`_ keltirilgan."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:36
msgid "the **name** you want for the database,"
msgstr "ma'lumotlar bazasi uchun istagan **nomingiz**,"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:37
msgid "what **version** the database is in,"
msgstr "ma'lumotlar bazasi qaysi **versiyada** ekanligi,"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:38
msgid "the login (email) of the **administrator** user,"
msgstr "**administrator** foydalanuvchining logini (email),"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:39
msgid "whether you wish to have a first **test** deployment, and"
msgstr "avval **test** joylashtirish (deploy) qilishni istaysizmi, va"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:42
msgid ""
"This is strongly recommended, especially if you have ever installed third-"
"party apps."
msgstr ""
"Bu, ayniqsa uchinchi tomon ilovalarini o'rnatgan bo'lsangiz, qat'iy tavsiya "
"etiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:44
msgid ""
"**when** you will want the production database to be put online (day, time "
"of day, and your timezone)."
msgstr ""
"ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar bazasi **qachon** onlayn holatga "
"keltirilishini istaysiz (kun, kun vaqti va vaqt mintaqangiz)."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:46
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:121
msgid ""
"Odoo then makes sure the database is compatible before putting it online. In "
"case of technical issues during the process, Odoo might contact you."
msgstr ""
"Keyin Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasini onlayn qilishdan oldin uning mosligini "
"tekshiradi. Jarayon davomida texnik muammolar yuzaga kelsa, Odoo siz bilan "
"bog'lanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:50
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:125
msgid ""
"If you have time constraints, `create a support ticket <https://www.odoo.com/"
"help-form>`_ as soon as possible to schedule the transfer."
msgstr ""
"Agar vaqt cheklovlaringiz bo'lsa, ko'chirishni rejalashtirish uchun imkon "
"qadar tezroq `qo'llab-quvvatlash so'rovini yarating <https://www.odoo.com/"
"help-form>`_."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:54
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:92
msgid "To Odoo.sh"
msgstr "Odoo.sh-ga"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:56
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:99
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions found in :ref:`the Import a database section <odoo-"
"sh/create/import>` of the Odoo.sh *Create a project* documentation."
msgstr ""
"Odoo.sh *Loyiha yaratish* hujjatlarining :ref:`Ma'lumotlar bazasini import "
"qilish bo'limidagi <odoo-sh/create/import>` ko'rsatmalarga amal qiling."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:60
msgid "Transferring an Odoo Online database"
msgstr "Odoo Online ma'lumotlar bazasini ko'chirish"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:63
msgid ""
"Odoo Online's :doc:`intermediary versions <standard_extended_support>` are "
"not supported by Odoo.sh or on-premise. Therefore, if the database to "
"transfer is running an intermediary version, it must be upgraded first to "
"the next :doc:`major version <standard_extended_support>`, waiting for its "
"release if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Online-ning :doc:`oraliq versiyalari <standard_extended_support>` "
"Odoo.sh yoki on-premise tomonidan qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi. Shuning uchun, "
"ko'chiriladigan ma'lumotlar bazasi oraliq versiyada ishlayotgan bo'lsa, u "
"avval keyingi :doc:`asosiy versiyaga <standard_extended_support>` "
"yangilanishi (upgrade) kerak, zarur bo'lsa uning relizini kutish lozim."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:69
msgid ""
"Transferring an online database running on Odoo 16.3 would require first "
"upgrading it to Odoo 17.0."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 16.3 da ishlayotgan onlayn ma'lumotlar bazasini ko'chirish uchun avval "
"uni Odoo 17.0 ga yangilash (upgrade) talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:73
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`gear`) button next to the database "
"name on the `Odoo Online database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases/"
">`_ to display its version number."
msgstr ""
"Versiya raqamini ko'rsatish uchun `Odoo Online ma'lumotlar bazasi menejerida "
"<https://www.odoo.com/my/databases/>`_ ma'lumotlar bazasi nomi "
"yonidagi :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`gear`) tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:77
msgid ""
"If there is an active Odoo subscription linked to the database being "
"migrated, reach out to the Customer Service Manager or `contact Odoo support "
"<https://www.odoo.com/help>`_ to complete the subscription transfer."
msgstr ""
"Agar migratsiya qilinayotgan ma'lumotlar bazasiga bog'langan faol Odoo "
"obunasi mavjud bo'lsa, obunani ko'chirishni yakunlash uchun Mijozlarga "
"xizmat ko'rsatish menejeriga murojaat qiling yoki `Odoo qo'llab-quvvatlash "
"xizmati bilan bog'laning <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:82
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:134
msgid "To on-premise"
msgstr "On-premise-ga"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:84
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:94
msgid ""
"Download a database backup by signing in to `the Odoo Online database "
"manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases/>`_, clicking the :icon:`fa-gear` "
"(:guilabel:`gear`) button next to the database name, then "
"selecting :icon:`fa-cloud-download` :guilabel:`Download`. If the download "
"fails due to the file being too large, `contact Odoo support <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Odoo Online ma'lumotlar bazasi menejeriga <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"databases/>`_ kirib, ma'lumotlar bazasi nomi yonidagi :icon:`fa-gear` "
"(:guilabel:`gear`) tugmasini bosing, so'ngra :icon:`fa-cloud-"
"download` :guilabel:`Download` ni tanlash orqali ma'lumotlar bazasining "
"zaxira nusxasini yuklab oling. Agar fayl juda katta bo'lgani sababli yuklab "
"olish muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lsa, `Odoo qo'llab-quvvatlash xizmati bilan "
"bog'laning <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:89
#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:137
msgid ""
"Restore the database from the database manager on your local server using "
"the backup."
msgstr ""
"Zaxira nusxadan foydalanib, lokal serveringizdagi ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"menejeri orqali ma'lumotlar bazasini tiklang."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:103
msgid "Transferring an Odoo.sh database"
msgstr "Odoo.sh ma'lumotlar bazasini ko'chirish"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:111
msgid ""
"Uninstall all **non-standard apps** in a staging build before doing it in "
"the production build."
msgstr ""
"Barcha **nostandart ilovalarni** avval sinov (staging) build-da o'chirib "
"tashlang, keyin buni ishlab chiqarish (production) build-da bajaring."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:116
msgid "which **branch** should be migrated,"
msgstr "qaysi **shox (branch)** migratsiya qilinishi kerakligi,"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:117
msgid ""
"in which **region** you want the database to be hosted (Americas, Europe, or "
"Asia),"
msgstr ""
"ma'lumotlar bazasi qaysi **mintaqada** hosting qilinishini istaysiz "
"(Amerika, Yevropa yoki Osiyo),"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:118
msgid "which user(s) will be the **administrator(s)**, and"
msgstr "qaysi foydalanuvchi(lar) **administrator(lar)** bo'lishi, va"

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:119
msgid ""
"**when** (and in which timezone) you want the database to be up and running."
msgstr ""
"ma'lumotlar bazasi **qachon** (va qaysi vaqt mintaqasida) ishga tushishini "
"istaysiz."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:127
msgid "Select the **region** closest to most of your users to reduce latency."
msgstr ""
"Kechikishni kamaytirish uchun foydalanuvchilaringizning ko'pchiligiga eng "
"yaqin **mintaqani** tanlang."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:128
msgid "Future **administrator(s)** must have an Odoo.com account."
msgstr "Bo'lajak **administrator(lar)** Odoo.com hisobiga ega bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:129
msgid ""
"The **date and time** you want the database to be up and running are helpful "
"to organize the switch from the Odoo.sh server to the Odoo Online servers."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasi ishga tushishini istagan **sana va vaqt** Odoo.sh "
"serveridan Odoo Online serverlariga o'tishni tashkil qilishda yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:131
msgid "Databases are **not reachable** during their migration."
msgstr "Migratsiya davomida ma'lumotlar bazalariga **kirish mumkin emas**."

#: ../../content/administration/hosting.rst:136
msgid ""
"Download a :ref:`backup of your Odoo.sh production database <odoo-sh/"
"branches/tabs/backups>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Odoo.sh ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar bazangizning zaxira "
"nusxasini <odoo-sh/branches/tabs/backups>` yuklab oling."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:3
msgid "Odoo mobile apps"
msgstr "Odoo mobil ilovalari"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:5
msgid ""
"Two kind of Odoo mobile app exist: the progressive web app (PWA) and store "
"apps. Using the PWA is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Odoo mobil ilovasining ikki turi mavjud: progressiv veb-ilova (PWA) va "
"do'kon ilovalari. PWA dan foydalanish tavsiya etiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:9
msgid "Progressive web app (PWA)"
msgstr "Progressiv veb-ilova (PWA)"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:11
msgid ""
"PWAs are web-based applications designed to function across different "
"devices and platforms, leveraging web browsers to deliver user experiences "
"similar to native apps."
msgstr ""
"PWA lar turli qurilmalar va platformalarda ishlashga mo'ljallangan veb-"
"ilovalar bo'lib, ular veb-brauzerlar yordamida nativ ilovalarga o'xshash "
"foydalanuvchi tajribasini taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:14
msgid "The Odoo PWA features include:"
msgstr "Odoo PWA imkoniyatlariga quyidagilar kiradi:"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:16
msgid "Quick access by adding the PWA to a device's home screen"
msgstr "PWA ni qurilmaning bosh ekraniga qo'shish orqali tezkor kirish"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:17
msgid "Seamless and borderless navigation experience"
msgstr "Uzluksiz va chegarasiz navigatsiya tajribasi"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:18
msgid "Push notifications"
msgstr "Push bildirishnomalar"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:19
msgid "SSO authentication"
msgstr "SSO autentifikatsiyasi"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:21
msgid ""
"To install the Odoo PWA, launch a browser supporting PWAs, and sign in to an "
"Odoo database. The instructions to install a PWA depend on the platform and "
"browser used."
msgstr ""
"Odoo PWA ni o'rnatish uchun PWA ni qo'llab-quvvatlaydigan brauzerni ishga "
"tushiring va Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasiga kiring. PWA ni o'rnatish bo'yicha "
"ko'rsatmalar foydalanilayotgan platforma va brauzerga bog'liq."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:26
msgid "Android"
msgstr "Android"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Chrome**: open Chrome's menu (:guilabel:`⋮`), select :guilabel:`Install "
"app`, and tap :guilabel:`Install`."
msgstr ""
"**Chrome**: Chrome menyusini oching (:guilabel:`⋮`), :guilabel:`Install app` "
"ni tanlang va :guilabel:`Install` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Firefox**: open Firefox's menu (:guilabel:`⋮`), "
"select :guilabel:`Install`, and either touch and hold the Odoo icon or "
"tap :guilabel:`Add automatically`."
msgstr ""
"**Firefox**: Firefox menyusini oching (:guilabel:`⋮`), :guilabel:`Install` "
"ni tanlang va Odoo belgisini bosib turing yoki :guilabel:`Add automatically` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:34
msgid ""
"The PWA can also be installed with **Samsung Internet**, **Edge**, and "
"**Opera**."
msgstr ""
"PWA ni **Samsung Internet**, **Edge** va **Opera** yordamida ham o'rnatish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:36
msgid "iOS"
msgstr "iOS"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Safari**: open the **Share** menu by tapping the square with an arrow "
"pointing upwards icon, select :guilabel:`Add to Home Screen`, edit the PWA "
"details if desired, and tap :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"**Safari**: yuqoriga yo'naltirilgan strelkali kvadrat belgisini bosib "
"**Share** menyusini oching, :guilabel:`Add to Home Screen` ni tanlang, agar "
"xohlasangiz PWA tafsilotlarini tahrirlang va :guilabel:`Add` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:42
msgid ""
"On iOS 16.4 and above, the PWA can also be installed with **Chrome**, "
"**Firefox**, and **Edge**."
msgstr ""
"iOS 16.4 va undan yuqori versiyalarda PWA ni **Chrome**, **Firefox** va "
"**Edge** yordamida ham o'rnatish mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:45
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Desktop"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Chrome** and **Edge**: click the installation icon at the right of the "
"address bar and click :guilabel:`Install`."
msgstr ""
"**Chrome** va **Edge**: manzil panelining o'ng tomonidagi o'rnatish "
"belgisini bosing va :guilabel:`Install` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:51
msgid ""
"`Google Chrome Help: Use progressive web apps <https://support.google.com/"
"chrome/answer/9658361>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google Chrome Yordami: Progressiv veb-ilovalardan foydalanish <https://"
"support.google.com/chrome/answer/9658361>`_"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:53
msgid ""
"`MDN Web Docs: Installing and uninstalling web apps <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Progressive_web_apps/Guides/"
"Installing>`_"
msgstr ""
"`MDN Web Docs: Veb-ilovalarni o'rnatish va o'chirish <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Progressive_web_apps/Guides/"
"Installing>`_"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:55
msgid ""
"`Microsoft Support: Install, manage, or uninstall apps in Microsoft Edge "
"<https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/topic/install-manage-or-uninstall-apps-"
"in-microsoft-edge-0c156575-a94a-45e4-a54f-3a84846f6113>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Microsoft Qo'llab-quvvatlash: Microsoft Edge da ilovalarni o'rnatish, "
"boshqarish yoki o'chirish <https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/topic/install-"
"manage-or-uninstall-apps-in-microsoft-edge-0c156575-a94a-45e4-"
"a54f-3a84846f6113>`_"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:58
msgid "Store apps"
msgstr "Do'kon ilovalari"

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:60
msgid ""
"The Odoo mobile apps are available for download on the `Google Play Store "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.odoo.mobile>`_ and `Apple "
"App Store <https://apps.apple.com/app/odoo/id1272543640>`_."
msgstr ""
"Odoo mobil ilovalarini `Google Play Store <https://play.google.com/store/"
"apps/details?id=com.odoo.mobile>`_ va `Apple App Store <https://"
"apps.apple.com/app/odoo/id1272543640>`_ dan yuklab olish mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/mobile.rst:64
msgid ""
"While the store apps support multi-accounts, they are not compatible with "
"SSO authentication."
msgstr ""
"Do'kon ilovalari bir nechta akkauntlarni qo'llab-quvvatlasa-da, ular SSO "
"autentifikatsiyasi bilan mos kelmaydi."

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:3
msgid "Neutralized database"
msgstr "Neytrallashtirilgan ma'lumotlar bazasi"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:5
msgid ""
"A neutralized database is a non-production database on which several "
"parameters are deactivated. This enables one to carry out tests without the "
"risk of launching specific automated processes that could impact production "
"data (e.g., sending emails to customers). Live access is removed and turned "
"into a testing environment."
msgstr ""
"Neytrallashtirilgan ma'lumotlar bazasi — bu bir nechta parametrlari "
"o'chirilgan, ishlab chiqarish (production) uchun mo'ljallanmagan ma'lumotlar "
"bazasi. Bu ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlariga ta'sir qilishi "
"mumkin bo'lgan muayyan avtomatlashtirilgan jarayonlarni (masalan, mijozlarga "
"email yuborish) ishga tushirish xavfisiz testlarni o'tkazish imkonini "
"beradi. Jonli kirish (dostup) olib tashlanadi va u test muhitiga "
"aylantiriladi."

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:11
msgid "**Any testing database created is a neutralized database:**"
msgstr ""
"**Yaratilgan har qanday test ma'lumotlar bazasi neytrallashtirilgan "
"ma'lumotlar bazasidir:**"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:13
msgid "testing backup databases"
msgstr "test uchun zaxira nusxa ma'lumotlar bazalari"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:14
msgid "duplicate databases"
msgstr "nusxalangan ma'lumotlar bazalari"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:15
msgid "for Odoo.sh: staging and development databases"
msgstr ""
"Odoo.sh uchun: sinov (staging) va ishlab chiqish (development) ma'lumotlar "
"bazalari"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:18
msgid ""
"A database can also be neutralized when upgrading, as it is vital to do some "
"tests before switching to a new version."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasi yangilash (upgrade) paytida ham neytrallashtirilishi "
"mumkin, chunki yangi versiyaga o'tishdan oldin ba'zi testlarni o'tkazish "
"juda muhimdir."

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:22
msgid "Deactivated features"
msgstr "O'chirilgan funksiyalar"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:24
msgid "Here is a non-exhaustive list of the deactivated features:"
msgstr ""
"Quyida o'chirilgan funksiyalarning to'liq bo'lmagan ro'yxati keltirilgan:"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:26
msgid ""
"all planned actions (e.g., automatic invoicing of subscriptions, mass "
"mailing, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"barcha rejalashtirilgan amallar (masalan, obunalar uchun avtomatik hisob-"
"faktura yaratish, ommaviy xat yuborish va h.k.)"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:27
msgid "outgoing emails"
msgstr "chiquvchi emaillar"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:28
msgid "bank synchronization"
msgstr "bank sinxronizatsiyasi"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:29
msgid "payment providers"
msgstr "to'lov provayderlari"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:30
msgid "delivery methods"
msgstr "yetkazib berish usullari"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:31
msgid ":abbr:`IAP (In-App Purchase)` tokens"
msgstr ":abbr:`IAP (In-App Purchase)` tokenlari"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:32
msgid "website visibility (prevent search engines from indexing your site)"
msgstr ""
"veb-sayt ko'rinuvchanligi (qidiruv tizimlarining saytingizni indekslashining "
"oldini oladi)"

#: ../../content/administration/neutralized_database.rst:35
msgid ""
"**A red banner at the top of the screen is displayed on the neutralized "
"database so that it can be seen immediately.**"
msgstr ""
"**Neytrallashtirilgan ma'lumotlar bazasida uni darhol payqash mumkin "
"bo'lishi uchun ekranning yuqori qismida qizil banner ko'rsatiladi.**"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:3
msgid "Odoo.com account"
msgstr "Odoo.com akkaunti"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:5
msgid ""
"Open the `Connection & Security page <https://www.odoo.com/my/security>`_ on "
"your Odoo.com account portal to:"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagilarni bajarish uchun Odoo.com akkauntingiz portalidagi `Connection & "
"Security sahifasini <https://www.odoo.com/my/security>`_ oching:"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:8
msgid "Change your :guilabel:`Password`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Password` ni o'zgartirish."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:11
msgid ""
"When you create a database, a user linked to your Odoo.com account is "
"generated on the database. Changing your Odoo.com account's password will "
"also modify the password used to sign in with that user to the database."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasini yaratganingizda, ma'lumotlar bazasida Odoo.com "
"akkauntingizga bog'langan foydalanuvchi yaratiladi. Odoo.com "
"akkauntingizning parolini o'zgartirish ushbu foydalanuvchi bilan ma'lumotlar "
"bazasiga kirishda ishlatiladigan parolni ham o'zgartiradi."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:14
msgid ""
"You can set a database-specific password for that user by going to "
"the :ref:`database's settings <users/change-password>`. However, you will "
"still be able to sign in with your Odoo.com account's password."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ma'lumotlar bazasi sozlamalariga <users/change-password>` o'tib, ushbu "
"foydalanuvchi uchun ma'lumotlar bazasiga xos parol o'rnatishingiz mumkin. "
"Biroq, siz baribir Odoo.com akkauntingizning paroli bilan kira olasiz."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:18
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Two-factor authentication` using an authenticator app."
msgstr ""
"Autentifikator ilovasi yordamida :guilabel:`Two-factor authentication` ni "
"yoqish."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:21
msgid ""
"Refer to the :doc:`Two-factor authentication documentation <../applications/"
"general/users/2fa>` for more information. The process to enable it for a "
"database user and for your Odoo.com account is similar."
msgstr ""
"Batafsil ma'lumot uchun :doc:`Ikki bosqichli autentifikatsiya hujjatlariga "
"<../applications/general/users/2fa>` murojaat qiling. Uni ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"foydalanuvchisi uchun va Odoo.com akkauntingiz uchun yoqish jarayoni "
"o'xshash."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Log out from all devices` signed in to your Odoo.com account, "
"except for the current session."
msgstr ""
"Joriy seansdan tashqari, Odoo.com akkauntingizga kirilgan barcha "
"qurilmalardan chiqish uchun :guilabel:`Log out from all devices`."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:29
msgid ""
"To log out from the current session, click the :icon:`fa-user-circle-o` "
"(:guilabel:`user`) icon in the top right and select :icon:`fa-sign-"
"out` :guilabel:`Logout`."
msgstr ""
"Joriy seansdan chiqish uchun yuqori o'ng burchakdagi :icon:`fa-user-circle-"
"o` (:guilabel:`user`) belgisini bosing va :icon:`fa-sign-"
"out` :guilabel:`Logout` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:32
msgid ""
"Enable :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` to add a :ref:`developer API "
"key <api/external_api/keys>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`dasturchi API kalitini <api/external_api/keys>` qo'shish "
"uchun :ref:`dasturchi rejimini <developer-mode>` yoqish."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:35
msgid ":guilabel:`Delete` your account."
msgstr "Akkauntingizni :guilabel:`Delete` qilish."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:38
msgid ""
"Deleting your Odoo.com account is **irreversible**. Once deleted, your "
"account **cannot be retrieved**."
msgstr ""
"Odoo.com akkauntingizni o'chirish **qaytarib bo'lmaydigan** amaldir. "
"O'chirilgandan so'ng, akkauntingizni **tiklab bo'lmaydi**."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:41
msgid ""
"Open the `Account Information page <https://www.odoo.com/my/account>`_ to "
"edit your account details, including your **email address**."
msgstr ""
"Akkaunt ma'lumotlaringizni, jumladan **email manzilingizni** tahrirlash "
"uchun `Account Information sahifasini <https://www.odoo.com/my/account>`_ "
"oching."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:45
msgid ""
"When you create a database, a user linked to your Odoo.com account is "
"generated on the database. Changing your Odoo.com account's email address "
"does not modify the email address used to sign in with that user."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasini yaratganingizda, ma'lumotlar bazasida Odoo.com "
"akkauntingizga bog'langan foydalanuvchi yaratiladi. Odoo.com "
"akkauntingizning email manzilini o'zgartirish ushbu foydalanuvchi bilan "
"kirishda ishlatiladigan email manzilini o'zgartirmaydi."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:48
msgid ""
"You can set a database-specific email address for that user by clicking your "
"avatar in the top-right corner of the database and selecting :guilabel:`My "
"Preferences`. You will still need to sign in to the database using the email "
"address used at the time of the database creation."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasining yuqori o'ng burchagidagi avataringizni bosib "
"va :guilabel:`My Preferences` ni tanlab, ushbu foydalanuvchi uchun "
"ma'lumotlar bazasiga xos email manzilini o'rnatishingiz mumkin. Baribir "
"ma'lumotlar bazasiga uni yaratish paytida ishlatilgan email manzili bilan "
"kirishingiz kerak bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:51
msgid ""
"To change the email address used to sign in to a database, `contact Odoo "
"Support <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasiga kirishda ishlatiladigan email manzilini o'zgartirish "
"uchun `Odoo Qo'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_accounts.rst:55
msgid ""
"In addition to the database you create, all databases you are :ref:`invited "
"to join <users/add-individual>` with your Odoo.com account's email address "
"will be displayed under the `database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"databases>`_."
msgstr ""
"Siz yaratgan ma'lumotlar bazasidan tashqari, Odoo.com akkauntingizning email "
"manzili bilan :ref:`qo'shilishga taklif qilingan <users/add-individual>` "
"barcha ma'lumotlar bazalari `ma'lumotlar bazasi menejeri <https://"
"www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_ ostida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:3
#: ../../content/administration/odoo_sh/getting_started/create.rst:121
#: ../../content/administration/standard_extended_support.rst:30
#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:14
#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:109
#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:330
msgid "Odoo Online"
msgstr "Odoo Online"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:5
msgid ""
"`Odoo Online <https://www.odoo.com/trial>`_ offers private databases hosted "
"and managed by Odoo. Odoo Online databases can be accessed using any web "
"browser and do not require a local installation. They can be used for long-"
"term production or to thoroughly test Odoo, including customizations that do "
"not require custom code."
msgstr ""
"`Odoo Online <https://www.odoo.com/trial>`_ Odoo tomonidan joylashtirilgan "
"va boshqariladigan xususiy ma'lumotlar bazalarini taklif etadi. Odoo Online "
"ma'lumotlar bazalariga istalgan veb-brauzer orqali kirish mumkin va ular "
"lokal o'rnatishni talab qilmaydi. Ulardan uzoq muddatli ishlab chiqarish "
"(production) uchun yoki Odoo ni, jumladan maxsus kod talab qilmaydigan "
"moslashtirishlarni chuqur test qilish uchun foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:11
msgid ""
"To quickly try out Odoo, shared `demo databases <https://demo.odoo.com>`_ "
"are available for testing. No registration is required; however, each "
"database is only available for a few hours."
msgstr ""
"Odoo-ni tezda sinab ko'rish uchun umumiy `demo ma'lumotlar bazalari <https://"
"demo.odoo.com>`_ test uchun mavjud. Ro'yxatdan o'tish talab qilinmaydi; ammo "
"har bir ma'lumotlar bazasi faqat bir necha soat davomida mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:15
msgid ""
"Odoo Online is incompatible with custom modules or modules from the `Odoo "
"Apps Store <https://apps.odoo.com/apps>`_."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Online maxsus modullar yoki `Odoo Apps Store <https://apps.odoo.com/"
"apps>`_ dagi modullar bilan mos kelmaydi."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:21
msgid "Database manager"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasi menejeri"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:23
msgid ""
"To manage an Odoo Online database, open to the `database manager <https://"
"www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_ and sign in as the database administrator."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Online ma'lumotlar bazasini boshqarish uchun `ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"menejeri <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_ ni oching va ma'lumotlar "
"bazasi administratori sifatida tizimga kiring."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:29
msgid "Domain names"
msgstr "Domen nomlari"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:31
msgid ""
":doc:`Configure a custom domain name <../applications/websites/website/"
"configuration/domain_names>` by selecting a database and clicking :icon:`fa-"
"globe` :guilabel:`Domain Names`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasini tanlab, :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Domain Names` "
"tugmasini bosish orqali :doc:`maxsus domen nomini sozlang <../applications/"
"websites/website/configuration/domain_names>`."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:35
msgid ":ref:`Register a domain name for free <domain-name/register>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Domen nomini bepul ro'yxatdan o'tkazing <domain-name/register>`."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:40
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Teglar"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:42
msgid ""
"Add tags to identify and sort databases by selecting a database and "
"clicking :icon:`fa-tags` :guilabel:`Tags`. In the dialog box, enter a tag, "
"click the :icon:`fa-plus-circle` (:guilabel:`plus`) button, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasini tanlab, :icon:`fa-tags` :guilabel:`Tags` tugmasini "
"bosish orqali ma'lumotlar bazalarini aniqlash va saralash uchun teglar "
"qo'shing. Muloqot oynasida teg kiriting, :icon:`fa-plus-circle` "
"(:guilabel:`plus`) tugmasini bosing va :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:47
msgid "Search for tags in the :icon:`fa-search` search bar at the top right."
msgstr ""
"Yuqori o'ng burchakdagi :icon:`fa-search` qidiruv panelida teglarni qidiring."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:52
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "Yashirish"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:54
msgid ""
"Permanently hide the database from the database manager by selecting it and "
"clicking :icon:`fa-eye-slash` :guilabel:`Hide`. In the dialog box, "
"click :guilabel:`Yes, I don't need it anymore`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasini tanlab, :icon:`fa-eye-slash` :guilabel:`Hide` tugmasini "
"bosish orqali uni ma'lumotlar bazasi menejeridan butunlay yashiring. Muloqot "
"oynasida :guilabel:`Yes, I don't need it anymore` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:59
msgid "It is possible to access a hidden database through its URL."
msgstr ""
"Yashirilgan ma'lumotlar bazasiga uning URL manzili orqali kirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:64
msgid "Manage"
msgstr "Boshqarish"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:66
msgid ""
"Access all other database management options by selecting it and "
"clicking :icon:`fa-gears` :guilabel:`Manage`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasini tanlab, :icon:`fa-gears` :guilabel:`Manage` tugmasini "
"bosish orqali boshqa barcha ma'lumotlar bazasini boshqarish opsiyalariga "
"kiring."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:70
msgid "Switch plans"
msgstr "Tarif rejalarini almashtirish"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:72
msgid ""
"Switch `pricing plans <https://www.odoo.com/pricing>`_ by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Switch` under the desired plan."
msgstr ""
"Kerakli reja ostidagi :guilabel:`Switch` tugmasini bosish orqali `tarif "
"rejalarini <https://www.odoo.com/pricing>`_ almashtiring."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:78
#: ../../content/administration/odoo_sh/getting_started/branches.rst:525
#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:3
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Yangilash (upgrade)"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:80
msgid ""
"Launch a :ref:`database upgrade <upgrade-request-test>` by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Upgrade`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Upgrade` tugmasini bosish orqali :ref:`ma'lumotlar bazasini "
"yangilashni <upgrade-request-test>` boshlang."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:83
msgid "This option is only displayed when an upgrade is available."
msgstr "Bu opsiya faqat yangilash (upgrade) mavjud bo'lganda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:88
msgid "Rename"
msgstr "Nomini o'zgartirish"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:90
msgid ""
"Rename and change the URL of a database by clicking :guilabel:`Rename`. In "
"the dialog box, enter a :guilabel:`New name` and click :guilabel:`Rename`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rename` tugmasini bosish orqali ma'lumotlar bazasining nomini va "
"URL manzilini o'zgartiring. Muloqot oynasida :guilabel:`New name` kiriting "
"va :guilabel:`Rename` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:96
msgid "Duplicate"
msgstr "Nusxalash"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:98
msgid ""
"Create a copy of the database by clicking :guilabel:`Duplicate`. In the "
"dialog box, enter a :guilabel:`New name` and click :guilabel:`Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Duplicate` tugmasini bosish orqali ma'lumotlar bazasining "
"nusxasini yarating. Muloqot oynasida :guilabel:`New name` kiriting "
"va :guilabel:`Duplicate` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:102
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`For testing purposes` option is enabled. It "
"disables all external actions (emails, payments, delivery orders, etc.) on "
"the duplicated database."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda :guilabel:`For testing purposes` opsiyasi yoqilgan bo'ladi. "
"U nusxalangan ma'lumotlar bazasidagi barcha tashqi amallarni (emaillar, "
"to'lovlar, yetkazib berish buyurtmalari va h.k.) o'chirib qo'yadi."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:104
msgid "Duplicates expire after 15 days."
msgstr "Nusxalarning amal qilish muddati 15 kundan keyin tugaydi."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:105
msgid ""
"A maximum of five duplicates can be created per database. Under "
"extraordinary circumstances, contact `Odoo Support <https://www.odoo.com/"
"help>`_ to extend the limit."
msgstr ""
"Har bir ma'lumotlar bazasi uchun ko'pi bilan beshta nusxa yaratish mumkin. "
"Favqulodda holatlarda limitni oshirish uchun `Odoo Support <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_ ga murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:111
#: ../../content/administration/odoo_sh/getting_started/create.rst:97
msgid "Download a backup"
msgstr "Zaxira nusxani yuklab olish"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:113
msgid ""
"Download a ZIP file containing a database backup by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Download Backup`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Download Backup` tugmasini bosish orqali ma'lumotlar bazasining "
"zaxira nusxasini o'z ichiga olgan ZIP faylni yuklab oling."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:116
msgid ""
"Databases are backed up daily as per the `Odoo Cloud Hosting SLA <https://"
"www.odoo.com/cloud-sla>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazalari `Odoo Cloud Hosting SLA <https://www.odoo.com/cloud-"
"sla>`_ ga muvofiq har kuni zaxiralanadi."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:118
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Download Backup` option is disabled, it means the database "
"is too large to be downloaded using the database manager. Contact `Odoo "
"Support <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_ to request an alternative download "
"solution."
msgstr ""
"Agar :guilabel:`Download Backup` opsiyasi o'chirilgan bo'lsa, bu ma'lumotlar "
"bazasi ma'lumotlar bazasi menejeri orqali yuklab olish uchun juda katta "
"ekanligini bildiradi. Muqobil yuklab olish yechimini so'rash uchun `Odoo "
"Support <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_ ga murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:125
msgid "View admin activity logs"
msgstr "Administrator faoliyati loglarini ko'rish"

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:127
msgid ""
"View the logs of all actions taken by Odoo employees or the database "
"administrator on the database by clicking :guilabel:`View Admin Activity "
"Logs`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`View Admin Activity Logs` tugmasini bosish orqali Odoo xodimlari "
"yoki ma'lumotlar bazasi administratori tomonidan ma'lumotlar bazasida "
"bajarilgan barcha amallarning loglarini ko'ring."

#: ../../content/administration/odoo_online.rst:131
msgid ""
"Actions taken by Odoo employees are typically the result of requests "
