#: ../../content/administration/on_premise/source.rst:5
msgid ""
"The source 'installation' is not about installing Odoo but running it "
"directly from the source instead."
msgstr ""
"Manba kodidan 'o'rnatish' Odoo'ni o'rnatish emas, balki uni to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri manba kodidan ishga tushirishni anglatadi."

#: ../../content/administration/on_premise/source.rst:8
msgid ""
"Using the Odoo source can be more convenient for module developers as it is "
"more easily accessible than using packaged installers."
msgstr ""
"Odoo manba kodidan foydalanish modul ishlab chiquvchilari uchun qulayroq "
"bo'lishi mumkin, chunki u paketlangan o'rnatuvchilardan foydalanishga "
"qaraganda osonroq kirish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/administration/on_premise/source.rst:11
msgid ""
"It makes starting and stopping Odoo more flexible and explicit than the "
"services set up by the packaged installers. Also, it allows overriding "
"settings using :ref:`command-line parameters <reference/cmdline>` without "
"needing to edit a configuration file."
msgstr ""
"Bu Odoo'ni ishga tushirish va to'xtatishni paketlangan o'rnatuvchilar "
"tomonidan sozlangan xizmatlarga qaraganda moslashuvchan va aniq qiladi. "
"Shuningdek, u konfiguratsiya faylini tahrirlashga hojat "
"qoldirmasdan :ref:`buyruq qatori parametrlari <reference/cmdline>` yordamida "
"sozlamalarni qayta belgilash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/administration/on_premise/source.rst:15
msgid ""
"Finally, it provides greater control over the system's setup and allows to "
"more easily keep (and run) multiple versions of Odoo side-by-side."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, u tizim sozlamalari ustidan ko'proq nazorat qilish imkonini beradi "
"va Odoo'ning bir nechta versiyalarini yonma-yon saqlash (va ishga "
"tushirish)ni osonlashtiradi."

