#: ../../content/administration/on_premise/source.rst:107
msgid ""
"**The Enterprise git repository does not contain the full Odoo source "
"code**. It is only a collection of extra add-ons. The main server code is in "
"the Community edition. Running the Enterprise version means running the "
"server from the Community version with the `addons-path` option set to the "
"folder with the Enterprise edition. It is required to clone both the "
"Community and Enterprise repositories to have a working Odoo Enterprise "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"**Enterprise git repozitoriysi to'liq Odoo manba kodini o'z ichiga "
"olmaydi**. U faqat qo'shimcha add-on'lar to'plamidir. Asosiy server kodi "
"Community nashrida joylashgan. Enterprise versiyasini ishga tushirish "
"serverni Community versiyasidan `addons-path` opsiyasini Enterprise nashri "
"joylashgan papkaga o'rnatilgan holda ishga tushirishni anglatadi. "
"Ishlaydigan Odoo Enterprise o'rnatmasiga ega bo'lish uchun ham Community, "
"ham Enterprise repozitoriylarini klonlash talab qilinadi."

