#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:5
msgid ""
"An upgrade involves moving a database from an older version to a newer "
"supported version (e.g., from Odoo 16.0 to Odoo 18.0). Regular upgrades are "
"crucial as each version offers new features, bug fixes, and security "
"patches. Using a :doc:`supported version <standard_extended_support>` is "
"strongly recommended. Each major version is supported for three years."
msgstr ""
"Yangilash (upgrade) ma'lumotlar bazasini eski versiyadan yangiroq qo'llab-"
"quvvatlanadigan versiyaga o'tkazishni anglatadi (masalan, Odoo 16.0 dan Odoo "
"18.0 ga). Muntazam yangilashlar juda muhim, chunki har bir versiya yangi "
"funksiyalar, xato tuzatishlari va xavfsizlik yamoqlarini taqdim "
"etadi. :doc:`Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan versiyadan <standard_extended_support>` "
"foydalanish qat'iy tavsiya etiladi. Har bir asosiy versiya uch yil davomida "
"qo'llab-quvvatlanadi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:10
msgid ""
"Depending on the hosting type and Odoo version used, a database upgrade can "
"be **mandatory**."
msgstr ""
"Hosting turi va foydalanilayotgan Odoo versiyasiga qarab, ma'lumotlar "
"bazasini yangilash **majburiy** bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:16
msgid ""
"If a database is on a **major version** (e.g., 16.0, 17.0, 18.0), an upgrade "
"is mandatory every two years."
msgstr ""
"Agar ma'lumotlar bazasi **asosiy versiyada** (masalan, 16.0, 17.0, 18.0) "
"bo'lsa, yangilash har ikki yilda majburiy hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:18
msgid ""
"If a database is on a **minor version** (e.g., 17.1, 17.2, 17.4), an upgrade "
"is mandatory a few weeks after the next version is released. Minor versions "
"are usually released every two months."
msgstr ""
"Agar ma'lumotlar bazasi **kichik versiyada** (masalan, 17.1, 17.2, 17.4) "
"bo'lsa, keyingi versiya chiqarilgandan bir necha hafta o'tgach yangilash "
"majburiy bo'ladi. Kichik versiyalar odatda har ikki oyda chiqariladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:24
msgid ""
"After the initial three years of support, you will have another two years to "
"complete the upgrade. You will be notified when an upgrade is required."
msgstr ""
"Dastlabki uch yillik qo'llab-quvvatlashdan so'ng, yangilashni yakunlash "
"uchun yana ikki yil vaqtingiz bo'ladi. Yangilash talab qilinganda sizga "
"xabar beriladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:0
msgid "The \"unsupported version\" popup on Odoo.sh."
msgstr ""
"Odoo.sh dagi \"qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydigan versiya\" qalqib chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:32
msgid ""
"You can stay on the same version indefinitely, even if it is not "
"recommended. Note that the smaller the version gap, the easier the upgrade "
"should be."
msgstr ""
"Tavsiya etilmasa ham, siz bir xil versiyada cheksiz muddat qolishingiz "
"mumkin. E'tibor bering, versiyalar orasidagi farq qanchalik kichik bo'lsa, "
"yangilash shunchalik oson bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:37
msgid ""
"You will receive a notification in your database a few weeks before a "
"mandatory upgrade will be automatically carried out. You are in control of "
"the process as long as the deadline is not reached."
msgstr ""
"Majburiy yangilash avtomatik ravishda amalga oshirilishidan bir necha hafta "
"oldin ma'lumotlar bazangizda bildirishnoma olasiz. Belgilangan muddat yetib "
"kelmaguncha jarayon sizning nazoratingizda bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:0
msgid "The upgrade message prompt on the top right of the database"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasining yuqori o'ng qismidagi yangilash haqidagi xabar"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:44
msgid ""
"Concretely, Odoo’s Upgrade Team performs a silent test upgrade of every "
"database that should be upgraded. If the test is successful and lasts less "
"than 20 minutes, you can directly trigger the upgrade from the database. If "
"the test fails, you can test an upgrade using the `database manager <https://"
"www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_."
msgstr ""
"Aniqroq aytganda, Odoo'ning Upgrade jamoasi yangilanishi kerak bo'lgan har "
"bir ma'lumotlar bazasining yashirin test yangilashini amalga oshiradi. Agar "
"test muvaffaqiyatli bo'lsa va 20 daqiqadan kam davom etsa, yangilashni "
"to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ma'lumotlar bazasidan ishga tushirishingiz mumkin. Agar "
"test muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lsa, `database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"databases>`_ yordamida yangilashni sinab ko'rishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:49
msgid ""
"When you are invited to upgrade, it is strongly recommended to :ref:`request "
"an upgraded test database <upgrade-request-test>` first and spend "
"time :ref:`testing <upgrade-testing>` it."
msgstr ""
"Yangilashga taklif qilinganingizda, avval :ref:`yangilangan test ma'lumotlar "
"bazasini so'rash <upgrade-request-test>` va uni :ref:`testlashga <upgrade-"
"testing>` vaqt ajratish qat'iy tavsiya etiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:52
msgid ""
"An automatic upgrade to the next version will be triggered if no action is "
"taken before the specified due date."
msgstr ""
"Agar belgilangan muddatgacha hech qanday chora ko'rilmasa, keyingi versiyaga "
"avtomatik yangilash ishga tushiriladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:55
msgid "An upgrade does not cover:"
msgstr "Yangilash quyidagilarni qamrab olmaydi:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:57
msgid "Downgrading to a previous version of Odoo"
msgstr "Odoo'ning oldingi versiyasiga qaytish (downgrade)"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:58
msgid ""
":doc:`Switching editions <on_premise/community_to_enterprise>` (e.g., from "
"Community to Enterprise)"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Nashrlarni almashtirish <on_premise/community_to_enterprise>` "
"(masalan, Community'dan Enterprise'ga)"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:60
msgid ""
":ref:`Changing hosting type <hosting/change-solution>` (e.g., from on-"
"premise to Odoo Online)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Hosting turini o'zgartirish <hosting/change-solution>` (masalan, on-"
"premise'dan Odoo Online'ga)"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:61
msgid "Migrating from another ERP to Odoo"
msgstr "Boshqa ERP tizimidan Odoo'ga migratsiya qilish"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:64
msgid ""
"If your database contains custom modules, it cannot be upgraded until a "
"version of your custom modules is available for the target version of Odoo. "
"For customers maintaining their own custom modules, we recommend to "
"parallelize the process by :ref:`requesting an upgraded database <upgrade-"
"request-test>` while also :doc:`upgrading the source code of your custom "
"modules </developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db>`."
msgstr ""
"Agar ma'lumotlar bazangizda maxsus modullar bo'lsa, maxsus modullaringizning "
"Odoo'ning maqsadli versiyasiga mos versiyasi mavjud bo'lmaguncha uni "
"yangilab bo'lmaydi. O'z maxsus modullarini o'zlari qo'llab-quvvatlaydigan "
"mijozlarga jarayonni parallellashtirishni tavsiya qilamiz: :ref:`yangilangan "
"ma'lumotlar bazasini so'rash <upgrade-request-test>` bilan bir "
"vaqtda :doc:`maxsus modullaringizning manba kodini yangilash </developer/"
"howtos/upgrade_custom_db>`."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:73
msgid "Upgrading in a nutshell"
msgstr "Qisqacha yangilash jarayoni"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:75
msgid ""
"Request an upgraded test database (see :ref:`obtaining an upgraded test "
"database <upgrade-request-test>`)."
msgstr ""
"Yangilangan test ma'lumotlar bazasini so'rang (:ref:`yangilangan test "
"ma'lumotlar bazasini olish <upgrade-request-test>` bo'limiga qarang)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:77
msgid ""
"If applicable, upgrade the source code of your custom module to be "
"compatible with the new version of Odoo (see :doc:`/developer/howtos/"
"upgrade_custom_db`)."
msgstr ""
"Agar kerak bo'lsa, maxsus modulingizning manba kodini Odoo'ning yangi "
"versiyasiga mos bo'lishi uchun yangilang (:doc:`/developer/howtos/"
"upgrade_custom_db` sahifasiga qarang)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:79
msgid ""
"Thoroughly test the upgraded database (see :ref:`testing the new version of "
"the database <upgrade-testing>`)."
msgstr ""
"Yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasini har tomonlama testdan o'tkazing "
"(:ref:`ma'lumotlar bazasining yangi versiyasini testlash <upgrade-testing>` "
"bo'limiga qarang)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:81
msgid ""
"Report any issue encountered during the testing to Odoo by going to the "
"`Support page and selecting \"An issue related to my future upgrade (I am "
"testing an upgrade)\" <https://www.odoo.com/help?stage=migration>`_."
msgstr ""
"Testlash davomida duch kelingan har qanday muammo haqida Odoo'ga xabar "
"berish uchun `Support sahifasiga o'tib, \"An issue related to my future "
"upgrade (I am testing an upgrade)\" bandini tanlang <https://www.odoo.com/"
"help?stage=migration>`_."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:84
msgid ""
"Once all issues are resolved and you are confident that the upgraded "
"database can be used as your main database without any issues, plan the "
"upgrade of your production database."
msgstr ""
"Barcha muammolar hal qilingach va yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasidan asosiy "
"ma'lumotlar bazangiz sifatida muammosiz foydalanish mumkinligiga ishonch "
"hosil qilganingizdan so'ng, ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar "
"bazangizni yangilashni rejalashtiring."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:86
msgid ""
"Request the upgrade for the production database, rendering it unavailable "
"for the time it takes to complete the process (see :ref:`upgrading the "
"production database <upgrade-production>`)."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar bazasi uchun yangilashni so'rang; "
"jarayon yakunlangunga qadar u mavjud bo'lmaydi (:ref:`ishlab chiqarish "
"ma'lumotlar bazasini yangilash <upgrade-production>` bo'limiga qarang)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:88
msgid ""
"Report any issue encountered during the upgrade to Odoo by going to the "
"`Support page and selecting \"An issue related to my upgrade (production)\" "
"<https://www.odoo.com/help?stage=post_upgrade>`_."
msgstr ""
"Yangilash davomida duch kelingan har qanday muammo haqida Odoo'ga xabar "
"berish uchun `Support sahifasiga o'tib, \"An issue related to my upgrade "
"(production)\" bandini tanlang <https://www.odoo.com/help?"
"stage=post_upgrade>`_."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:95
msgid "Obtaining an upgraded test database"
msgstr "Yangilangan test ma'lumotlar bazasini olish"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:97
msgid ""
"The `Upgrade page <https://upgrade.odoo.com>`_ is the main platform for "
"requesting an upgraded database. However, depending on the hosting type, you "
"can upgrade from the command line (on-premise), the Odoo Online `database "
"manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_, or your `Odoo.sh project "
"<https://www.odoo.sh/project>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Upgrade sahifasi <https://upgrade.odoo.com>`_ yangilangan ma'lumotlar "
"bazasini so'rash uchun asosiy platformadir. Biroq, hosting turiga qarab, "
"buyruq qatori (on-premise), Odoo Online `database manager <https://"
"www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_ yoki `Odoo.sh loyihangiz <https://www.odoo.sh/"
"project>`_ orqali yangilashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:103
msgid ""
"The Upgrade platform follows the same `Privacy Policy <https://www.odoo.com/"
"privacy>`_ as the other Odoo.com services. Visit the `General Data "
"Protection Regulation page <https://www.odoo.com/gdpr>`_ to learn more about "
"how Odoo handles your data and privacy."
msgstr ""
"Upgrade platformasi boshqa Odoo.com xizmatlari kabi bir xil `Maxfiylik "
"siyosatiga <https://www.odoo.com/privacy>`_ amal qiladi. Odoo sizning "
"ma'lumotlaringiz va maxfiyligingiz bilan qanday ishlashi haqida ko'proq "
"bilish uchun `General Data Protection Regulation sahifasiga <https://"
"www.odoo.com/gdpr>`_ tashrif buyuring."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:111
msgid "To upgrade an Odoo Online database:"
msgstr "Odoo Online ma'lumotlar bazasini yangilash uchun:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:113
msgid "Open the `database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_."
msgstr "`Database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_ ni oching."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:114
msgid "Select the database and click :icon:`fa-gears` :guilabel:`Manage`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasini tanlang va :icon:`fa-gears` :guilabel:`Manage` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:115
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Upgrade` in the :guilabel:`Database` section."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Database` bo'limida :guilabel:`Upgrade` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:116
msgid "In the popup:"
msgstr "Qalqib chiquvchi oynada:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:118
msgid ""
"Select the **version** of Odoo you want to upgrade to, usually the latest "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Yangilamoqchi bo'lgan Odoo **versiyasini** tanlang, odatda bu eng so'nggi "
"versiya bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:119
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Email to notify`, which will receive a link to the "
"upgraded database."
msgstr ""
"Yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasiga havolani qabul qiladigan :guilabel:`Email "
"to notify` manzilini kiriting."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:121
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Purpose` of the upgrade, which is automatically set "
"to :guilabel:`Test` for your first upgrade request."
msgstr ""
"Yangilashning :guilabel:`Purpose` qiymatini tanlang, u birinchi yangilash "
"(upgrade) so'rovingiz uchun avtomatik ravishda :guilabel:`Test` qilib "
"o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:123
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Upgrade`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Upgrade` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:125
msgid ""
"In the database manager, the :guilabel:`Connect` button will be replaced by "
"an unclickable :guilabel:`Upgrading...` button until completion. Once the "
"process is successful, an email containing a link to the upgraded test "
"database is sent to the address provided. The test database can also be "
"accessed from the database manager by clicking the :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
"(:guilabel:`caret down`) button before the database name to display the test "
"database, then clicking :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasi menejerida :guilabel:`Connect` tugmasi jarayon tugagunga "
"qadar bosib bo'lmaydigan :guilabel:`Upgrading...` tugmasi bilan "
"almashtiriladi. Jarayon muvaffaqiyatli yakunlangach, ko'rsatilgan manzilga "
"yangilangan test ma'lumotlar bazasiga havolani o'z ichiga olgan email "
"yuboriladi. Test ma'lumotlar bazasiga ma'lumotlar bazasi menejeridan ham "
"kirish mumkin: buning uchun test ma'lumotlar bazasini ko'rsatish maqsadida "
"ma'lumotlar bazasi nomi oldidagi :icon:`fa-caret-down` (:guilabel:`caret "
"down`) tugmasini bosing, so'ng :guilabel:`Connect` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:134
msgid ""
"Odoo.sh is integrated with the upgrade platform to simplify the upgrade "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Yangilash jarayonini soddalashtirish uchun Odoo.sh yangilash platformasi "
"bilan integratsiya qilingan."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:0
msgid "Odoo.sh project and tabs"
msgstr "Odoo.sh loyihasi va varaqlari"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:139
msgid ""
"The **latest production daily automatic backup** is then sent to the Upgrade "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra **eng so'nggi ishlab chiqarish (production) kunlik avtomatik zaxira "
"nusxasi** Upgrade platformasiga yuboriladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:141
msgid ""
"Once the upgrade platform is done upgrading the backup and uploading it on "
"the branch, it is put in a **special mode**: each time a **commit is "
"pushed** on the branch, a **restore operation** of the upgraded backup and "
"an **update of all the custom modules** occur. This allows you to test your "
"custom modules on a pristine copy of the upgraded database. The log file of "
"the upgrade process can be found in your newly upgraded staging build by "
"going to :file:`~/logs/upgrade.log`."
msgstr ""
"Yangilash platformasi zaxira nusxani yangilab, uni shox (branch)ga yuklab "
"bo'lgach, u **maxsus rejimga** o'tkaziladi: shox (branch)ga har safar "
"**commit yuborilganda (push)**, yangilangan zaxira nusxaning **tiklash "
"operatsiyasi** va **barcha maxsus modullarning yangilanishi** amalga "
"oshiriladi. Bu maxsus modullaringizni yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasining "
"toza nusxasida sinab ko'rish imkonini beradi. Yangilash jarayonining log "
"faylini yangi yangilangan sinov (staging) build ichida :file:`~/logs/"
"upgrade.log` manziliga o'tish orqali topish mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:149
msgid ""
"In databases where custom modules are installed, their source code must be "
"up-to-date with the target version of Odoo before the upgrade can be "
"performed. If there are none, the \"update on commit\" mode is skipped, the "
"upgraded database is built as soon as it is transferred from the upgrade "
"platform, and the upgrade mode is exited."
msgstr ""
"Maxsus modullar o'rnatilgan ma'lumotlar bazalarida, yangilashni amalga "
"oshirishdan oldin ularning manba kodi Odoo'ning maqsadli versiyasiga mos "
"ravishda yangilangan bo'lishi kerak. Agar ular bo'lmasa, \"update on "
"commit\" rejimi o'tkazib yuboriladi, yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"yangilash platformasidan o'tkazilishi bilanoq build qilinadi va yangilash "
"rejimidan chiqiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:154
msgid ""
"Check out the :doc:`/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db` page for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Batafsil ma'lumot uchun :doc:`/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db` "
"sahifasini ko'rib chiqing."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:158
msgid ""
"The standard upgrade process can be initiated by entering the following "
"command line on the machine where the database is hosted:"
msgstr ""
"Standart yangilash jarayonini ma'lumotlar bazasi joylashgan mashinada "
"quyidagi buyruq qatorini kiritish orqali boshlash mumkin:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:166
msgid "This command has some requirements on the environment it runs in:"
msgstr "Bu buyruqning u ishlaydigan muhitga nisbatan ba'zi talablari bor:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:168
msgid ""
"Some external commands that must be provided by the operating system, "
"normally found in any Linux distribution (including WSL). An error will be "
"displayed if one or several of them are missing."
msgstr ""
"Operatsion tizim tomonidan taqdim etilishi kerak bo'lgan, odatda har qanday "
"Linux distributivida (shu jumladan WSL) mavjud bo'lgan ba'zi tashqi "
"buyruqlar. Agar ulardan biri yoki bir nechtasi yetishmasa, xato ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:171
msgid ""
"The system user that executes the command needs to be configured with access "
"to the database. Please refer to the PostgreSQL documentation of the `client "
"environment <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/libpq-envars.html>`_ or "
"the `client password file <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/libpq-"
"pgpass.html>`_ for this requirement."
msgstr ""
"Buyruqni bajaradigan tizim foydalanuvchisi ma'lumotlar bazasiga kirish "
"(dostup) bilan sozlangan bo'lishi kerak. Bu talab bo'yicha PostgreSQL "
"hujjatlaridagi `client environment <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/"
"libpq-envars.html>`_ yoki `client password file <https://www.postgresql.org/"
"docs/current/libpq-pgpass.html>`_ bo'limlariga murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:175
msgid ""
"The script needs to be able to reach one or multiple servers of the upgrade "
"platform both on TCP port 443 and to any random TCP port in the range "
"between 32768 and 60999. This can be in conflict with your restrictive "
"firewall and may need an exception added to the firewall configuration."
msgstr ""
"Skript yangilash platformasining bir yoki bir nechta serverlariga ham TCP "
"443 porti orqali, ham 32768 va 60999 oralig'idagi istalgan tasodifiy TCP "
"port orqali ulana olishi kerak. Bu sizning cheklovchi firewall'ingiz bilan "
"ziddiyatga kirishishi mumkin va firewall konfiguratsiyasiga istisno "
"qo'shishni talab qilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:180
msgid ""
"The following command can be used to display the general help and the main "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Umumiy yordam va asosiy buyruqlarni ko'rsatish uchun quyidagi buyruqdan "
"foydalanish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:186
msgid ""
"An upgraded test database can also be requested via the `Upgrade page "
"<https://upgrade.odoo.com>`_."
msgstr ""
"Yangilangan test ma'lumotlar bazasini `Upgrade sahifasi <https://"
"upgrade.odoo.com>`_ orqali ham so'rash mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:190
msgid ""
"In databases where custom modules are installed, their source code must be "
"up-to-date with the target version of Odoo before the upgrade can be "
"performed. Check out the :doc:`/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db` page for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Maxsus modullar o'rnatilgan ma'lumotlar bazalarida, yangilashni amalga "
"oshirishdan oldin ularning manba kodi Odoo'ning maqsadli versiyasiga mos "
"ravishda yangilangan bo'lishi kerak. Batafsil ma'lumot uchun :doc:`/"
"developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db` sahifasini ko'rib chiqing."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:195
msgid ""
"For security reasons, only the person who submitted the upgrade request can "
"download it."
msgstr ""
"Xavfsizlik sabablariga ko'ra, uni faqat yangilash so'rovini yuborgan shaxs "
"yuklab olishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:196
msgid ""
"For storage reasons, the database's copy is submitted without a filestore to "
"the upgrade server. Therefore, the upgraded database does not contain the "
"production filestore."
msgstr ""
"Saqlash hajmi sabablariga ko'ra, ma'lumotlar bazasining nusxasi yangilash "
"serveriga filestore'siz yuboriladi. Shu sababli, yangilangan ma'lumotlar "
"bazasi ishlab chiqarish (production) filestore'ini o'z ichiga olmaydi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:198
msgid ""
"Before restoring the upgraded database, its filestore must be merged with "
"the production filestore to be able to perform tests in the same conditions "
"as it would be in the new version."
msgstr ""
"Yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasini tiklashdan oldin, testlarni yangi "
"versiyadagi kabi bir xil sharoitlarda o'tkazish imkoniga ega bo'lish uchun "
"uning filestore'i ishlab chiqarish (production) filestore'i bilan "
"birlashtirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:201
msgid "The upgraded database contains:"
msgstr "Yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasi quyidagilarni o'z ichiga oladi:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:203
msgid "A `dump.sql` file containing the upgraded database"
msgstr "Yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasini o'z ichiga olgan `dump.sql` fayli"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:204
msgid ""
"A `filestore` folder containing files extracted from in-database records "
"into attachments (if there are any) and new standard Odoo files from the "
"targeted Odoo version (e.g., new images, icons, payment provider's logos, "
"etc.). This is the folder that should be merged with the production "
"filestore in order to get the full upgraded filestore."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasi ichidagi yozuvlardan biriktirmalarga ajratib olingan "
"fayllar (agar mavjud bo'lsa) va maqsadli Odoo versiyasidagi yangi standart "
"Odoo fayllarini (masalan, yangi rasmlar, ikonkalar, to'lov provayderlari "
"logotiplari va hokazo) o'z ichiga olgan `filestore` papkasi. To'liq "
"yangilangan filestore'ga ega bo'lish uchun aynan shu papka ishlab chiqarish "
"(production) filestore'i bilan birlashtirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:211
msgid ""
"You can request multiple test databases if you wish to test an upgrade more "
"than once."
msgstr ""
"Agar yangilashni bir necha marta sinab ko'rmoqchi bo'lsangiz, bir nechta "
"test ma'lumotlar bazalarini so'rashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:214
msgid ""
"When an upgrade request is completed, an upgrade report is attached to the "
"successful upgrade email, and it becomes available in the Discuss app for "
"users who are part of the \"Administration / Settings\" group. This report "
"provides important information about the changes introduced by the new "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Yangilash so'rovi yakunlanganda, muvaffaqiyatli yangilash emailiga yangilash "
"hisoboti biriktiriladi va u \"Administration / Settings\" guruhiga kiruvchi "
"foydalanuvchilar uchun Discuss ilovasida mavjud bo'ladi. Bu hisobot yangi "
"versiya kiritgan o'zgarishlar haqida muhim ma'lumotlarni taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:222
msgid "Testing the new version of the database"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasining yangi versiyasini testdan o'tkazish"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:224
msgid ""
"It is essential to test the upgraded test database to ensure that you are "
"not stuck in your day-to-day activities by a change in views, behavior, or "
"an error message once the upgrade goes live."
msgstr ""
"Yangilash ishga tushirilgandan so'ng ko'rinishlardagi o'zgarish, xatti-"
"harakat yoki xato xabari tufayli kundalik faoliyatingiz to'xtab qolmasligiga "
"ishonch hosil qilish uchun yangilangan test ma'lumotlar bazasini testdan "
"o'tkazish juda muhimdir."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:229
msgid ""
"Test databases are neutralized, and some features are disabled to prevent "
"them from impacting the production database:"
msgstr ""
"Test ma'lumotlar bazalari neytrallashtiriladi va ularning ishlab chiqarish "
"(production) ma'lumotlar bazasiga ta'sir qilishining oldini olish uchun "
"ba'zi funksiyalar o'chirib qo'yiladi:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:232
msgid "Scheduled actions are disabled."
msgstr "Rejalashtirilgan amallar o'chirib qo'yiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:233
msgid ""
"Outgoing mail servers are disabled by archiving the existing ones and adding "
"a fake one."
msgstr ""
"Chiquvchi pochta serverlari mavjudlarini arxivlash va soxta serverni "
"qo'shish orqali o'chirib qo'yiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:234
msgid ""
"Payment providers and delivery carriers are reset to the test environment."
msgstr ""
"To'lov provayderlari va yetkazib berish tashuvchilari test muhitiga qayta "
"o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:235
msgid ""
"Bank synchronization is disabled. Should you want to test the "
"synchronization, contact your bank synchronization provider to get sandbox "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"Bank sinxronizatsiyasi o'chirib qo'yiladi. Agar sinxronizatsiyani sinab "
"ko'rmoqchi bo'lsangiz, sandbox hisob ma'lumotlarini olish uchun bank "
"sinxronizatsiyasi provayderingizga murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:238
msgid ""
"Testing as many of your business flows as possible is strongly recommended "
"to ensure they are working correctly and to get more familiar with the new "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Biznes jarayonlaringizning to'g'ri ishlashiga ishonch hosil qilish va yangi "
"versiya bilan yaqinroq tanishish uchun ulardan imkon qadar ko'prog'ini "
"testdan o'tkazish qat'iy tavsiya etiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:241
msgid "Basic test checklist"
msgstr "Asosiy test nazorat ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:243
msgid ""
"Are there views that are deactivated in your test database but active in "
"your production database?"
msgstr ""
"Test ma'lumotlar bazangizda faolsizlantirilgan, lekin ishlab chiqarish "
"(production) ma'lumotlar bazangizda faol bo'lgan ko'rinishlar bormi?"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:245
msgid "Are your usual views still displayed correctly?"
msgstr "Odatiy ko'rinishlaringiz hali ham to'g'ri ko'rsatilyaptimi?"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:246
msgid "Are your reports (invoice, sales order, etc.) correctly generated?"
msgstr ""
"Hisobotlaringiz (hisob-faktura, sotuv buyurtmasi va hokazo) to'g'ri "
"yaratilyaptimi?"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:247
msgid "Are your website pages working correctly?"
msgstr "Veb-sayt sahifalaringiz to'g'ri ishlayaptimi?"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:248
msgid ""
"Are you able to create and modify records? (sales orders, invoices, "
"purchases, users, contacts, companies, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Yozuvlarni yaratish va o'zgartirish imkoniga egamisiz? (sotuv buyurtmalari, "
"hisob-fakturalar, xaridlar, foydalanuvchilar, kontaktlar, kompaniyalar va "
"hokazo)"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:250
msgid "Are there any issues with your mail templates?"
msgstr "Pochta shablonlaringizda biror muammo bormi?"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:251
msgid "Are there any issues with saved translations?"
msgstr "Saqlangan tarjimalarda biror muammo bormi?"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:252
msgid "Are your search filters still present?"
msgstr "Qidiruv filtrlaringiz hali ham mavjudmi?"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:253
msgid "Can you export your data?"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlaringizni eksport qila olasizmi?"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:257
msgid ""
"Checking a random product in your product catalog and comparing its test and "
"production data to verify everything is the same (product category, selling "
"price, cost price, vendor, accounts, routes, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot katalogingizdan tasodifiy mahsulotni tekshirish va hamma narsa bir "
"xilligiga ishonch hosil qilish uchun uning test va ishlab chiqarish "
"(production) ma'lumotlarini solishtirish (mahsulot kategoriyasi, sotish "
"narxi, tannarx, yetkazib beruvchi, hisoblar, marshrutlar va hokazo)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:260
msgid "Buying this product (Purchase app)."
msgstr "Bu mahsulotni sotib olish (Purchase ilovasi)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:261
msgid "Confirming the reception of this product (Inventory app)."
msgstr "Bu mahsulotning qabul qilinishini tasdiqlash (Inventory ilovasi)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:262
msgid ""
"Checking if the route to receive this product is the same in your production "
"database (Inventory app)."
msgstr ""
"Bu mahsulotni qabul qilish marshruti ishlab chiqarish (production) "
"ma'lumotlar bazangizdagi bilan bir xil ekanligini tekshirish (Inventory "
"ilovasi)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:264
msgid "Selling this product (Sales app) to a random customer."
msgstr "Bu mahsulotni tasodifiy mijozga sotish (Sales ilovasi)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:265
msgid ""
"Opening your customer database (Contacts app), selecting a customer (or "
"company), and checking its data."
msgstr ""
"Mijozlar ma'lumotlar bazangizni ochish (Contacts ilovasi), mijozni (yoki "
"kompaniyani) tanlash va uning ma'lumotlarini tekshirish."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:267
msgid "Shipping this product (Inventory app)."
msgstr "Bu mahsulotni jo'natish (Inventory ilovasi)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:268
msgid ""
"Checking if the route to ship this product is the same as in your production "
"database (Inventory app)."
msgstr ""
"Bu mahsulotni jo'natish marshruti ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar "
"bazangizdagi bilan bir xil ekanligini tekshirish (Inventory ilovasi)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:270
msgid "Validating a customer invoice (Invoicing or Accounting app)."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz hisob-fakturasini tasdiqlash (Invoicing yoki Accounting ilovasi)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:271
msgid ""
"Crediting the invoice (issuing a credit note) and checking if it behaves as "
"in your production database."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-fakturani kreditlash (kredit-nota chiqarish) va uning ishlab chiqarish "
"(production) ma'lumotlar bazangizdagi kabi ishlashini tekshirish."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:273
msgid "Checking your reports' results (Accounting app)."
msgstr "Hisobotlaringiz natijalarini tekshirish (Accounting ilovasi)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:274
msgid ""
"Randomly checking your taxes, currencies, bank accounts, and fiscal year "
"(Accounting app)."
msgstr ""
"Soliqlaringiz, valyutalaringiz, bank hisoblaringiz va moliyaviy yilingizni "
"tasodifiy tartibda tekshirish (Accounting ilovasi)."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:275
msgid ""
"Making an online order (Website apps) from the product selection in your "
"shop until the checkout process and checking if everything behaves as in "
"your production database."
msgstr ""
"Do'koningizda mahsulot tanlashdan to buyurtmani rasmiylashtirish "
"jarayonigacha onlayn buyurtma berish (Website ilovalari) va hamma narsa "
"ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar bazangizdagi kabi ishlashini "
"tekshirish."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:278
msgid ""
"This list is **not** exhaustive. Extend the example to your other apps based "
"on your use of Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Bu ro'yxat to'liq **emas**. Odoo'dan foydalanishingizga qarab misolni boshqa "
"ilovalaringizga ham kengaytiring."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:280
msgid ""
"If you face an issue while testing your upgraded test database, you can "
"request the assistance of Odoo by going to the `Support page and selecting "
"\"An issue related to my future upgrade (I am testing an upgrade)\" <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help?stage=migration>`_. In any case, it is essential to report "
"any problem encountered during the testing to fix it before upgrading your "
"production database."
msgstr ""
"Yangilangan test ma'lumotlar bazangizni testdan o'tkazish paytida muammoga "
"duch kelsangiz, `Support sahifasiga o'tib, \"An issue related to my future "
"upgrade (I am testing an upgrade)\" bandini tanlash <https://www.odoo.com/"
"help?stage=migration>`_ orqali Odoo'dan yordam so'rashingiz mumkin. Har "
"qanday holatda ham, ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar bazangizni "
"yangilashdan oldin testdan o'tkazish paytida duch kelingan har qanday "
"muammoni tuzatish uchun u haqida xabar berish juda muhimdir."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:286
msgid ""
"You might encounter significant differences with standard views, features, "
"fields, and models during testing. Those changes cannot be reverted on a "
"case-by-case basis. However, if a change introduced by a new version breaks "
"a customization, it is the responsibility of the maintainer of your custom "
"module to make it compatible with the new version of Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Testdan o'tkazish paytida standart ko'rinishlar, funksiyalar, maydonlar va "
"modellarda sezilarli farqlarga duch kelishingiz mumkin. Bu o'zgarishlarni "
"alohida holatlar bo'yicha bekor qilib bo'lmaydi. Biroq, agar yangi versiya "
"kiritgan o'zgarish moslashtirishni buzsa, uni Odoo'ning yangi versiyasiga "
"moslashtirish maxsus modulingiz ta'minlovchisining mas'uliyatidir."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:292
msgid "Do not forget to test:"
msgstr "Quyidagilarni testdan o'tkazishni unutmang:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:294
msgid "Integrations with external software (EDI, APIs, etc.)"
msgstr "Tashqi dasturiy ta'minot bilan integratsiyalar (EDI, API'lar va h.k.)"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:295
msgid ""
"Workflows between different apps (online sales with eCommerce, converting a "
"lead all the way to a sales order, delivery of products, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Turli ilovalar orasidagi ish jarayonlari (eCommerce orqali onlayn savdo, "
"lidni to'liq savdo buyurtmasigacha aylantirish, mahsulotlarni yetkazib "
"berish va h.k.)"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:297
msgid "Data exports"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar eksporti"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:298
msgid "Automated actions"
msgstr "Avtomatlashtirilgan amallar"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:299
msgid ""
"Server actions in the action menu on form views, as well as by selecting "
"multiple records on list views"
msgstr ""
"Forma ko'rinishlarida amallar menyusidagi server amallari, shuningdek "
"ro'yxat ko'rinishlarida bir nechta yozuvlarni tanlash orqali bajariladigan "
"amallar"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:305
msgid "Upgrading the production database"
msgstr "Ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar bazasini yangilash (upgrade)"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:307
msgid ""
"Once the :ref:`tests <upgrade-testing>` are completed and you are confident "
"that the upgraded database can be used as your main database without any "
"issues, it is time to plan the go-live day."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Testlar <upgrade-testing>` tugallangach va yangilangan ma'lumotlar "
"bazasini hech qanday muammosiz asosiy ma'lumotlar bazasi sifatida ishlatish "
"mumkinligiga ishonch hosil qilganingizdan so'ng, ishga tushirish (go-live) "
"kunini rejalashtirish vaqti keladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:310
msgid ""
"Your production database will be unavailable during its upgrade. Therefore, "
"we recommend planning the upgrade at a time when the use of the database is "
"minimal."
msgstr ""
"Yangilash (upgrade) davomida ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar "
"bazangiz ishlamaydi. Shu sababli, yangilashni ma'lumotlar bazasidan "
"foydalanish minimal bo'lgan vaqtga rejalashtirishni tavsiya qilamiz."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:313
msgid ""
"As the standard upgrade scripts and your database are constantly evolving, "
"it is also recommended to frequently request another upgraded test database "
"to ensure that the upgrade process is still successful, especially if it "
"takes a long time to finish. **Fully rehearsing the upgrade process the day "
"before upgrading the production database is also recommended.**"
msgstr ""
"Standart yangilash skriptlari va ma'lumotlar bazangiz doimiy rivojlanib "
"borgani sababli, yangilash jarayoni hali ham muvaffaqiyatli ekanligiga "
"ishonch hosil qilish uchun, ayniqsa u tugashi uzoq vaqt olsa, tez-tez yana "
"bir yangilangan test ma'lumotlar bazasini so'rash ham tavsiya etiladi. "
"**Ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar bazasini yangilashdan bir kun "
"oldin yangilash jarayonini to'liq mashq qilib chiqish ham tavsiya etiladi.**"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:319
msgid "Going into production without first testing may lead to:"
msgstr ""
"Avval testdan o'tkazmasdan ishlab chiqarishga (production) o'tish "
"quyidagilarga olib kelishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:321
msgid "Users failing to adjust to the changes and new features"
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchilarning o'zgarishlar va yangi funksiyalarga moslasha olmasligi"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:322
msgid ""
"Business interruptions (e.g., no longer having the possibility to validate "
"an action)"
msgstr ""
"Biznes jarayonlarining to'xtab qolishi (masalan, biror amalni tasdiqlash "
"imkoniyatining yo'qolishi)"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:323
msgid ""
"Poor customer experience (e.g., an eCommerce website that does not work "
"correctly)"
msgstr ""
"Mijozlar uchun yomon tajriba (masalan, to'g'ri ishlamaydigan eCommerce veb-"
"sayti)"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:325
msgid ""
"The process of upgrading a production database is similar to upgrading a "
"test database, but with a few exceptions."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar bazasini yangilash jarayoni test "
"ma'lumotlar bazasini yangilashga o'xshaydi, ammo bir nechta istisnolar "
"mavjud."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:332
msgid ""
"The process is similar to :ref:`obtaining an upgraded test database <upgrade-"
"request-test>`, except for the purpose option, which must be set "
"to :guilabel:`Production` instead of :guilabel:`Test`."
msgstr ""
"Bu jarayon :ref:`yangilangan test ma'lumotlar bazasini olish <upgrade-"
"request-test>` jarayoniga o'xshaydi, faqat maqsad opsiyasi :guilabel:`Test` "
"o'rniga :guilabel:`Production` qilib belgilanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:337
msgid ""
"Once the upgrade is requested, the database will be unavailable until the "
"upgrade is finished. Once the process is completed, it is impossible to "
"revert to the previous version."
msgstr ""
"Yangilash (upgrade) so'ralgach, ma'lumotlar bazasi yangilash tugagunga qadar "
"ishlamaydi. Jarayon tugallangach, oldingi versiyaga qaytish imkonsiz."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:343
msgid ""
"The process is similar to :ref:`obtaining an upgraded test database <upgrade-"
"request-test>` on the :guilabel:`Production` branch."
msgstr ""
"Bu jarayon :guilabel:`Production` shoxida (branch) :ref:`yangilangan test "
"ma'lumotlar bazasini olish <upgrade-request-test>` jarayoniga o'xshaydi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:0
msgid "View from the upgrade tab"
msgstr "Yangilash (upgrade) varag'idan ko'rinish"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:349
msgid ""
"The process is **triggered as soon as a new commit is made** on the branch. "
"This allows the upgrade process to be synchronized with the deployment of "
"the custom modules' upgraded source code. If there are no custom modules, "
"the upgrade process is triggered immediately."
msgstr ""
"Jarayon shoxda (branch) **yangi commit qilinishi bilanoq ishga tushadi**. Bu "
"yangilash jarayonini maxsus modullarning yangilangan manba kodini "
"joylashtirish (deploy) bilan sinxronlashtirish imkonini beradi. Agar maxsus "
"modullar bo'lmasa, yangilash jarayoni darhol ishga tushadi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:355
msgid ""
"The database is unavailable throughout the process. If anything goes wrong, "
"the platform automatically reverts the upgrade, as it would be for a regular "
"update. In case of success, a backup of the database before the upgrade is "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Jarayon davomida ma'lumotlar bazasi ishlamaydi. Agar biror narsa noto'g'ri "
"ketsa, platforma oddiy yangilanishdagi kabi yangilashni (upgrade) avtomatik "
"ravishda bekor qiladi. Muvaffaqiyatli yakunlanganda esa, yangilashdan "
"oldingi ma'lumotlar bazasining zaxira nusxasi yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:359
msgid ""
"The update of your custom modules must be successful to complete the entire "
"upgrade process. Make sure the status of your staging upgrade "
"is :guilabel:`successful` before trying it in production. More information "
"on how to upgrade your custom modules can be found on :doc:`/developer/"
"howtos/upgrade_custom_db`."
msgstr ""
"Butun yangilash jarayonini yakunlash uchun maxsus modullaringizning "
"yangilanishi muvaffaqiyatli bo'lishi kerak. Ishlab chiqarishda (production) "
"sinab ko'rishdan oldin sinov (staging) yangilashingizning "
"holati :guilabel:`successful` ekanligiga ishonch hosil qiling. Maxsus "
"modullaringizni yangilash haqida qo'shimcha ma'lumotni :doc:`/developer/"
"howtos/upgrade_custom_db` sahifasida topishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:366
msgid ""
"The command to upgrade a database to production is similar to the one of "
"upgrading a test database except for the argument `test`, which must be "
"replaced by `production`:"
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasini ishlab chiqarishga (production) yangilash buyrug'i test "
"ma'lumotlar bazasini yangilash buyrug'iga o'xshaydi, faqat `test` argumenti "
"`production` bilan almashtirilishi kerak:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:373
msgid ""
"An upgraded production database can also be requested via the `Upgrade page "
"<https://upgrade.odoo.com>`_."
msgstr ""
"Yangilangan ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar bazasini `Upgrade "
"sahifasi <https://upgrade.odoo.com>`_ orqali ham so'rash mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:376
msgid ""
"Once the database is uploaded, any modification to your production database "
"will **not** be present on your upgraded database. This is why we recommend "
"not using it during the upgrade process."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasi yuklangach, ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar "
"bazangizga kiritilgan har qanday o'zgarish yangilangan ma'lumotlar "
"bazangizda mavjud **bo'lmaydi**. Shuning uchun yangilash jarayoni davomida "
"undan foydalanmaslikni tavsiya qilamiz."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:381
msgid ""
"When requesting an upgraded database for production purposes, the copy is "
"submitted without a filestore. Therefore, the upgraded database filestore "
"must be merged with the production filestore before deploying the new "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish (production) maqsadida yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"so'ralganda, nusxa filestore'siz yuboriladi. Shu sababli, yangi versiyani "
"joylashtirishdan (deploy) oldin yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasining "
"filestore'i ishlab chiqarish filestore'i bilan birlashtirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:385
msgid ""
"In case of an issue with your production database, you can request the "
"assistance of Odoo by going to the `Support page and selecting \"An issue "
"related to my upgrade (production)\" <https://www.odoo.com/help?"
"stage=post_upgrade>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqarish (production) ma'lumotlar bazangizda muammo yuzaga kelsa, "
"`Support sahifasiga o'tib, \"An issue related to my upgrade (production)\" "
"bandini tanlash <https://www.odoo.com/help?stage=post_upgrade>`_ orqali "
"Odoo'dan yordam so'rashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:392
msgid "Service-level agreement (SLA)"
msgstr "Xizmat ko'rsatish darajasi kelishuvi (SLA)"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:394
msgid ""
"With Odoo Enterprise, upgrading a database to the most recent version of "
"Odoo is **free**, including any support required to rectify potential "
"discrepancies in the upgraded database."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Enterprise bilan ma'lumotlar bazasini Odoo'ning eng so'nggi versiyasiga "
"yangilash **bepul**, shu jumladan yangilangan ma'lumotlar bazasidagi "
"ehtimoliy nomuvofiqliklarni tuzatish uchun zarur bo'lgan har qanday yordam "
"ham."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:397
msgid ""
"Information about the upgrade services included in the Enterprise Licence is "
"available in the :ref:`Odoo Enterprise Subscription Agreement <upgrade>`. "
"However, this section clarifies what upgrade services you can expect."
msgstr ""
"Enterprise litsenziyasiga kiritilgan yangilash xizmatlari haqidagi "
"ma'lumotlar :ref:`Odoo Enterprise obuna kelishuvida <upgrade>` mavjud. "
"Shunga qaramay, ushbu bo'lim qanday yangilash xizmatlarini kutishingiz "
"mumkinligini aniqlashtiradi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:404
msgid "Upgrade services covered by the SLA"
msgstr "SLA qamrab olgan yangilash xizmatlari"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:406
msgid ""
"Databases hosted on Odoo's cloud platforms (Odoo Online and Odoo.sh) or self-"
"hosted (On-Premise) can benefit from upgrade services at all times for:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo'ning bulut platformalarida (Odoo Online va Odoo.sh) joylashgan yoki "
"mustaqil joylashtirilgan (On-Premise) ma'lumotlar bazalari quyidagilar uchun "
"har doim yangilash xizmatlaridan foydalanishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:409
msgid "the upgrade of all **standard applications**;"
msgstr "barcha **standart ilovalarni** yangilash;"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:410
msgid ""
"the upgrade of all **customizations created with the Studio app**, as long "
"as Studio is still installed and the respective subscription is still "
"active; and"
msgstr ""
"Studio hali ham o'rnatilgan va tegishli obuna hali ham faol bo'lsa, **Studio "
"ilovasi bilan yaratilgan barcha moslashtirishlarni** yangilash; va"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:412
msgid ""
"the upgrade of all **developments and customizations covered by a "
"maintenance of customizations subscription**."
msgstr ""
"**moslashtirishlarga texnik xizmat ko'rsatish obunasi qamrab olgan barcha "
"ishlanmalar va moslashtirishlarni** yangilash."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:415
msgid ""
"Upgrade services are limited to the technical conversion and adaptation of a "
"database (standard modules and data) to make it compatible with the version "
"targeted by the upgrade."
msgstr ""
"Yangilash xizmatlari ma'lumotlar bazasini (standart modullar va "
"ma'lumotlarni) yangilash mo'ljallangan versiyaga mos qilish uchun texnik "
"konvertatsiya va moslashtirish bilan cheklanadi."

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:421
msgid "Upgrade services not covered by the SLA"
msgstr "SLA qamrab olmagan yangilash xizmatlari"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:423
msgid "The following upgrade-related services are **not** included:"
msgstr "Quyidagi yangilash bilan bog'liq xizmatlar kiritilgan **emas**:"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:425
msgid ""
"the **cleaning** of pre-existing data and configurations while upgrading;"
msgstr ""
"yangilash davomida oldindan mavjud ma'lumotlar va konfiguratsiyalarni "
"**tozalash**;"

#: ../../content/administration/upgrade.rst:426
msgid ""
"the upgrade of **additional modules not covered by a maintenance contract** "
"that are created in-house or by third parties, including Odoo partners; and"
msgstr ""
"ichki yoki uchinchi tomonlar, jumladan Odoo hamkorlari tomonidan yaratilgan "
"**texnik xizmat ko'rsatish shartnomasi qamrab olmagan qo'shimcha "
